WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:02.400
Narrator: Vladimir
Putin has told the world

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.610
that Russia is gearing up

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:07.110
for a mass vaccination program in October.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.180
Narrator: The key word here is registered,

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.391
after less than two months

00:00:18.391 --> 00:00:22.070
of human testing on fewer
than a hundred people.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:24.070
Russian researchers are actually behind

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:26.620
several other groups in the US and China.

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:27.674
In terms of the science,

00:00:27.674 --> 00:00:30.460
they've bent the rules around approval.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.510
- My initial reaction was

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:33.460
it was probably much ado about nothing.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:35.620
We don't know anything about this vaccine,

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:37.370
other than the fact that Vladimir Putin

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.010
got on the airwaves and said

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:41.160
this is going to be safe,

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.270
this is going to be effective.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.610
And one can only interpret
this as a political stunt.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:46.920
Narrator: So, what's missing?

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.630
The most essential step in proving

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:51.600
a vaccine is safe called Phase 3.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.290
It's the last phase of human trials

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:56.340
and it usually involves
tens of thousands of people.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.920
- So, without that Phase 3 data yet,

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.780
I'm very concerned that they will be using

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:04.365
and releasing a vaccine that
could potentially be unsafe,

00:01:04.365 --> 00:01:07.830
could potentially be just ineffective.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.210
- Russia passed laws in April

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.130
that would allow companies
working on vaccines

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:14.010
to bypass Phase 3 trials.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:16.150
Other countries have also
changed or accelerated

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:18.780
the process by which vaccines are made.

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.800
China OK'd a vaccine for military use

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:23.540
before publishing Phase 3 trial results.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.650
And in the United States, companies funded

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:27.370
by the Operation Warp Speed program

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:31.110
are overlapping multiple
phases of clinical trials.

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.100
Still, Putin has confidently claimed

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:37.517
to have tested the Russian
vaccine on his own family.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.340
Narrator: There are
currently more than 100

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:52.060
coronavirus vaccines in
development globally.

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:53.270
Researchers around the world

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.843
are in a race against time and each other.

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:59.850
But developing any new
vaccine typically takes years,

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:01.950
sometimes up to a decade.

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:03.500
So far, only a handful of groups

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:06.640
in the US and UK have entered Phase 3.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.880
Their plans for deployment are, as of now,

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:10.930
a bit less ambitious than Russia's.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:11.770
In the United States,

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.930
the Trump administration
partnered with the private sector

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:17.610
to deliver 300 million
doses by January 2021.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.230
And China has already offered
an experimental vaccine

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.720
to employees of state-run companies.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.360
The first country that
proves it can produce

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:26.200
a safe and effective vaccine

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.533
stands to gain billions of
dollars of foreign investment.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.830
The vaccine will be marketed as Sputnik V,

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.380
a nod to the world's
first satellite Sputnik I,

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.910
which the Soviet Union launched in 1957,

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:41.100
escalating the 20-year
space race with the US.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.914
As many as 20 countries have
already expressed interest,

00:02:43.914 --> 00:02:45.431
perhaps putting Sputnik V

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:48.960
in the lead of a biotech cold war.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.020
- I hope it's not a cold war.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.380
Certainly this pandemic has been

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.375
an equal opportunity employer.

00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:57.210
This virus affects all nations,

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:59.700
all ethnic backgrounds,
all religious groups.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.400
We should all be brought
together in this effort

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.190
because all of us are at risk.

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:07.283
I think what Vladimir Putin
has done is political theater.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.700
Narrator: Russia's
vaccine is being developed

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.420
at the Gamaleya Institute in Moscow.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.580
But in July, American, British,

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.230
and Canadian intelligence services

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:20.140
accused Russian hackers of
trying to steal vaccine-related

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:22.110
information from researchers abroad,

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:23.848
according to The New York Times.

00:03:23.848 --> 00:03:25.900
And there have been widespread reports

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:28.520
that scientists injected
themselves with the prototype

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.820
and rushed through other tests
to speed up the development.

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:34.690
- So, when people talk
about this being a race,

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.293
I say be careful what you wish for,

00:03:36.293 --> 00:03:38.700
because history tells us when you look

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.040
at the modern history of
the US vaccine program,

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.110
the first vaccines out are usually

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.113
replaced within a year or
two by better vaccines.

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:50.090
Narrator: Dr. Peter Hotez
has researched vaccines

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:52.590
for other coronaviruses for decades,

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.010
and they are notoriously difficult.

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:56.750
He says that the only way nations

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.920
can solve a pandemic is by cooperating.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:03.169
- I think we have to get
away from this business

00:04:03.169 --> 00:04:06.431
you know, of this
nationalism around vaccines,

00:04:06.431 --> 00:04:08.006
calling it the American vaccine

00:04:08.006 --> 00:04:11.450
or the Chinese vaccine
or the British vaccine.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.160
It doesn't work that way.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:16.160
Narrator: Historically,
nations have come together.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.850
- This concept of vaccine diplomacy,

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.370
how you build vaccines
jointly between nations

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:21.753
at the height of the Cold War

00:04:21.753 --> 00:04:24.031
and the two countries put aside

00:04:24.031 --> 00:04:26.780
their ideologies to work together.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:27.930
They did that for polio

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.090
and they wound up doing that

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:32.033
for the freeze-dried
smallpox vaccine as well.

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:36.360
- Those studies that were
done in the then-Soviet Union

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:40.350
were instrumental in getting
Sabin's oral polio vaccine

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.850
licensed in the United States.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.140
- And many Russians never considered

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:47.000
the coronavirus to be a serious threat.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.330
- So, people didn't take it
seriously in the beginning.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.600
Russian propaganda tried
to present coronavirus

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:59.600
as a part of some great foreign
conspiracy against Russia.

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:03.980
- So, even if the Russian
vaccine doesn't work,

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:06.730
Putin has little to lose
politically from approving it.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:12.160
- So, he needed to enforce his image

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:15.840
like a savior, a defender,

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:20.840
like someone who can
"make Russia great again."

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:27.230
So, if we are talking about people's life,

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:29.390
yeah, it's huge risk.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.907
But if we're talking about Putin's

00:05:33.587 --> 00:05:36.800
political and informational risks,

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.343
I don't think they're too high.

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:42.590
- Putin's announcement could be a tactic

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:45.573
to destabilize the vaccine
process in other countries

00:05:45.573 --> 00:05:47.720
and potentially undermine trust

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.530
in vaccines in Russia and abroad.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.480
Tara Smith studies vaccine hesitancy

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.650
at Kent State University in Ohio.

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.510
- You have that ripple
effect that, you know,

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:57.910
well, this one is not working

00:05:57.910 --> 00:05:59.330
or if this one causes side effects,

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.130
well, what about, you know, measles?

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.570
What about tetanus?

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:04.663
What about pertussis?

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:07.653
It can drive fear for those as well.

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:10.350
Narrator: If the Russian
vaccine does prove

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.920
to be safe and effective,

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:14.820
manufacturing enough doses
to share with the world

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:16.653
would be a tremendous challenge.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:20.120
- If the intention is to vaccinate

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:22.983
8 million people in the world,

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.710
that's going to require something

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.820
that's never been done before.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.700
- Dr. Stanley Plotkin is the godfather

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.020
of the rubella vaccine,

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:33.860
one of the most common
vaccines given to infants.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.730
He says there's no plan in place

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:37.283
for worldwide collaboration.

00:06:38.553 --> 00:06:42.357
- We'd have to suspend antitrust laws

00:06:45.216 --> 00:06:48.096
and allow collaboration between companies,

00:06:48.096 --> 00:06:52.290
and the companies would have to agree

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:58.290
in some cases to manufacture
somebody else's vaccines.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.100
The only way that will be possible

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:06.100
is if we have some sort of
agreement now between companies,

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:13.523
whether brokered by the
WHO or somebody else.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.550
I don't see that happening yet.

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:18.710
Narrator: The World Health Organization

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:21.730
has said it is discussing
the new COVID-19 vaccine

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:24.220
with Russian health authorities.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:27.200
- We hope that some of these vaccines

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:30.290
will prove to be safe and efficient

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:33.851
and that you will be able to get doses

00:07:33.851 --> 00:07:38.163
that will be distributed in an equal way.

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:40.870
- They have now got 14 vaccines

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.690
that they're moving forward with.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:46.480
The hard part comes, as you
note, with what happens next.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.300
I mean the hardest part
of this is going to

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:51.103
be implementation and
distribution of these vaccines.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.350
- Russian officials confirmed

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:55.290
that Phase 3 trials for their vaccine

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.880
moved forward with 2,000
volunteers on August 12.

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:01.773
One day after the announcement
of the vaccine's approval.

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:04.010
Mass production of the vaccine

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:06.000
could begin as soon as September,

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.170
a month earlier than results are expected

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.240
from Phase 3 trials for Moderna,

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:12.923
the US company furthest
along in the process.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.610
Russia was approaching 1 million

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:17.370
reported cases in mid-August,

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:19.010
putting it forth on the list of countries

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:22.230
with the most confirmed
infections in the world.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.473
More than 15,000 Russians have died.

